{
	"name": "Ambushing Expertise",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/stealth-hide-beast-eyes-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you’ve gotten very careful about covering your tracks to prepare perfect ambushes. Once per long rest, you can grant up to 5 creatures, including yourself, the benefits of the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.zlsdqrnf2t9thns7]{Pass Without Trace} spell without using magic. This effect lasts for 10 minutes so long as a given ally is within 60ft of you and can see you communicating with gestures.</p><p>In addition, treat any initiative roll below 10 as a 10 and add your modifiers as normal.</p>",
